title: AWS v2 ELB: Health
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors all AWS ELB and reports a summary of their states.

 To make this check work you have to configure the related special agent
 {Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}.

 The service state is

 - {OK} if the elastic load balancer is "in service"

 - {WARN} if it is "out of service"

 - {UNKNOWN} otherwise

discovery:
 One service is created.
